     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "A notice from the town hall",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "市 は 台風 の 前 に 避難所 を 開ける 予定 だ。",
       "alumno": "The city plans to open the shelter before the typhoon.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "担当者 は 設備 を 確認している が、実際 に 動かしてみない ことには 問題 が 分からない。",
       "alumno": "The person in charge is checking the equipment, but problems can't be found without actually running it.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "点検 が 終わり次第、職員 は 住民 に 避難所 を 案内する。",
       "alumno": "As soon as the inspection finishes, the staff will guide residents to the shelter.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "準備 の 速さ は 職員 の 人数 次第 で 変わる。",
       "alumno": "The speed of the preparation depends on the number of staff.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "市 は 安全 を 確認してから、開設 の 時間 を 発表する。",
       "alumno": "The city will announce the opening time after checking that it is safe.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
